    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18715" root="سبرت" body-key="s">
    
      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبْرَتَ</span></b>  <i>He begged;</i> and <i>became lowly,
humble,</i> or <i>submissive;</i> or <i>affected to be like
the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَاكِين</span> [or <i>destitute,</i> or <i>needy,</i> &amp;c.]; syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَنَعَ</span>; (K, TA; [omitted in the CK, and in my
MS. copy of the K erroneously written <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَنِعَ</span>;])
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَسْكَنَ</span>. (TA.)

